The camera tilts up with large amplitude at fast speed, catching her silhouette rising against the lantern-lit rain and crashing back down as the flip completes. [Shot 3] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts hard to a low-angle tracking shot just above the cobblestones. She lands in a forward stance with zero hesitation and converts the landing directly into a sprint-thrust, the jian already extended at shoulder height and running dead-center toward the lens; her feet drive in rapid accelerating strides, spraying water with every step, her cape streaming straight behind her. The camera tracks backward at fast speed, holding her charging figure and the approaching blade point centered in frame as she closes the distance in a blur. [Shot 4] At 00:05.000, the shot cuts to a tight side-tracking close-up at sword-arm level as she plants her front foot hard and unleashes three lightning-fast cuts in one continuous flow with no recovery between them: strike one, a horizontal slash right-to-left; strike two, an instant reverse diagonal from upper-left to lower-right, her torso snapping through the rotation; strike three, a rising vertical cut from low to high finishing in a wide forward stance, the blade overhead. The camera pans right at fast speed, the three steel arcs overlapping into a single continuous flash against the blurred lanterns; she holds the final pose for only a fraction of a second before dropping her chin and staring forward, breathing hard, rain streaming off the blade.\n\noverall_soundscape: A constant dense hiss of heavy rain on cobblestones and rooftops underlies everything. The opening double-slash rings with two sharp, rapid steel whistles nearly stacked on top of each other; the backflip adds a single hard cape-snap and a wet landing thud. The thrust is a rapid succession of splashing footfalls accelerating toward the lens. The three-slash combo fires off three clean metallic cuts in quick, overlapping succession, ending in a sharp stop followed immediately by the steady hiss of rain on the steel.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A relentless fast-tempo Chinese battle score with hammering frame-drum patterns and sharp erhu tremolo clusters that never let up, punctuated by hard taiko hits exactly on each sword strike and a single soaring suona cry that cuts off abruptly at the final landing pose.\n", 1344, 768, 124], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 16, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 17, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 27, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 18, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 19, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 20, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "ds": {"offset": [-1010.5229215538798, -419.0700590222796], "scale": 0.7513148009015777}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Group", "bounding": [439.6448669433594, 333.3891296386719, 681.40234375, 1100.71435546875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Group", "bounding": [1152.9793701171875, 252.741455078125, 2364.78369140625, 1012.4348754882812]}], "links": [[1, 23, 0, 1, 0, "VIDEO"], [2, 10, 0,